Sales of alternative milks have slowed as more consumers return to traditional dairy products.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:17.600
The shift reverses some of the growth seen in the previous decade when these products gained popularity partly for environmental reasons.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:24.920
