00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:47.260
The economist noted that alt milks went mainstream in the 2010s on the basis of perceived climate

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.100
advantages that later faced re-evaluation.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:55.820
Shoppers have returned to dairy in recent years, reducing the earlier momentum of plant-based

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.440
options.

