reuse shops accepting excess reusable shopping bags for redistribution rather than disposal.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:07.040
The suggestion emphasizes keeping bags visible at home to encourage repeated use before donation.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:12.820
The Associated Press presented the approach as a practical step that extends the life of

